{"source":"/*\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\ntitle      UI Variables                                    +\nproject    nord-atom-ui                                    +\nrepository https://github.com/arcticicestudio/nord-atom-ui +\nauthor     Arctic Ice Studio                               +\nemail      development@arcticicestudio.com                 +\ncopyright  Copyright (C) 2016                              +\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n\n[Index]\n  > Animations\n  > Base\n      Background\n      Text\n  > Components\n      Button\n      Gutter\n      Input\n      Overlay\n      Pane\n      Panel\n      Progress Indicator\n      Scrollbar\n      Site\n      Tab\n      Tooltip\n      Tree View\n  > Configurations\n  > Fonts\n  > Package Support\n      build\n      imdone-atom\n      markdown-preview\n  > Sizes\n      Base\n      Font\n      Input\n      Tab\n*/\n/*+---------+\n  + Imports +\n  +---------+*/\n/*\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\ntitle      Nord                                    +\nproject    nord                                    +\nversion    0.1.0                                   +\nrepository https://github.com/arcticicestudio/nord +\nauthor     Arctic Ice Studio                       +\nemail      development@arcticicestudio.com         +\ncopyright  Copyright (C) 2016                      +\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n\n[References]\nKSS\n  (http://warpspire.com/kss)\nkss-node\n  (https://github.com/kss-node/kss-node)\n*/\n/*+------------+\n  + Animations +\n  +------------+*/\n/*+------+\n  + Base +\n  +------+*/\n/*+--- Background ---+*/\n/*+--- Text ---+*/\n/*+------------+\n  + Components +\n  +------------+*/\n/*+--- Button ---+*/\n/*+--- Gutter ---+*/\n/*+--- Input ---+*/\n/*+--- Overlay ---+*/\n/*+--- Pane ---+*/\n/*+--- Panel ---+*/\n/*+--- Progress Indicator ---+*/\n/*+--- Scrollbar ---+*/\n/*+--- Site ---+*/\n/*+--- Tab ---+*/\n/*+--- Tooltip ---+*/\n/*+--- Tree View ---+*/\n/*+----------------+\n  + Configurations +\n  +----------------+*/\n/*+-------+\n  + Fonts +\n  +-------+*/\n/*+-----------------+\n  + Package Support +\n  +-----------------+*/\n/*+--- build ---+*/\n/*+--- imdone-atom ---+*/\n/*+--- indent-guide-improved ---+*/\n/*+--- markdown-preview ---+*/\n/*+--- tool-bar ---+*/\n/*+-------+\n  + Sizes +\n  +-------+*/\n/*+--- Base ---+*/\n/*+--- Font ---+*/\n/*+--- Input ---+*/\n/*+--- List ---+*/\n/*+--- Tab ---+*/\n.welcome {\n  display: flex;\n  font-size: 1.25em;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  color: #d8dee9;\n  background-color: #2e3440;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n}\n.welcome p {\n  line-height: inherit;\n}\n.welcome a {\n  color: #88c0d0;\n}\n.welcome ul {\n  padding-left: 2em;\n}\n.welcome label {\n  margin-top: 1em;\n  font-weight: normal;\n}\n.welcome .input-checkbox {\n  margin-top: -0.2em;\n  margin-right: .5em;\n}\n.welcome-container {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 580px;\n  min-width: 300px;\n  margin: auto;\n  padding: 3em 2em;\n}\n.welcome-header {\n  margin: 0 0 3em 0;\n}\n.welcome-logo {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 280px;\n  margin: 0 auto 2em auto;\n  color: #eceff4;\n}\n.welcome-title {\n  font-size: 1.4em;\n  text-align: center;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  margin: 1em 0;\n}\n.welcome-card {\n  margin: 1em 0;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  border: 1px solid #3b4252;\n  background-color: #343b49;\n}\n.welcome-summary {\n  padding: 1em 1.5em;\n  font-size: 1.1em;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n.welcome-summary:hover {\n  color: #e5e9f0;\n}\n.welcome-summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n  display: none;\n}\n.welcome-summary:before {\n  width: 20px;\n  color: rgba(216, 222, 233, 0.4);\n}\ndetails[open] .welcome-summary:before {\n  color: #eceff4;\n}\ndetails[open] .welcome-summary {\n  color: #eceff4;\n}\n.welcome-highlight {\n  color: #eceff4;\n}\n.welcome-detail {\n  border-top: 1px solid #3b4252;\n  padding: 1.5em;\n}\n.welcome-detail .welcome-note {\n  margin-bottom: 0;\n}\n.welcome-img {\n  display: block;\n  max-width: 100%;\n  border-radius: 3px;\n  margin: 0 0 1em 0;\n  border: 1px solid #3b4252;\n}\n.welcome-consent {\n  margin-top: 3em;\n}\n.welcome-consent-choices {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: row;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  margin: 1em -1em;\n}\n.welcome-consent-choices button {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n.welcome-consent-choices div {\n  margin: .5em 1em;\n  flex: 1;\n}\n.welcome-consent-choices .welcome-note {\n  margin-top: 1em;\n}\n.welcome-key {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: .3em .4em;\n  font-size: .8em;\n  line-height: 1;\n  border-radius: 3px;\n  color: #eceff4;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(216, 222, 233, 0.4);\n  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n}\n.welcome-love {\n  color: rgba(216, 222, 233, 0.4);\n}\n.welcome-love a {\n  color: rgba(216, 222, 233, 0.4);\n}\n.welcome-love .icon::before {\n  position: relative;\n  top: 1px;\n  width: auto;\n  margin-right: 0;\n  font-size: 1.5em;\n}\n.welcome-love .icon-logo-github::before {\n  top: 3px;\n}\n.welcome-note {\n  font-size: .86em;\n  color: rgba(216, 222, 233, 0.4);\n}\n.welcome-footer {\n  margin-top: 1em;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n"}